#: ../../language/error_codes/E4238.md:1
msgid "E4238"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4238.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `unknown_constr_pat_on_error`."
msgstr "编译器诊断名称：`unknown_constr_pat_on_error`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4238.md:5
msgid ""
"The pattern `Type::..` cannot be used when matching or catching a value "
"of type `Error`. This pattern handles future constructors of a concrete "
"[`#non_exhaustive`](../attributes/non_exhaustive.md) type, not the open "
"set of suberror types represented by `Error`."
msgstr "匹配或捕获 `Error` 类型的值时，不能使用 `Type::..` 模式。该模式用于处理具体的 [`#non_exhaustive`](../attributes/non_exhaustive.md) 类型未来增加的构造器，而不是 `Error` 所表示的开放子错误类型集合。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4238.md:10
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4238.md:12
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"#non_exhaustive\n"
"pub(all) suberror ParseError {\n"
"  InvalidInput\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn is_parse_error(error : Error) -> Bool {\n"
"  match error {\n"
"    ParseError::InvalidInput => true\n"
"    ParseError::.. => true\n"
"    _ => false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4238.md:16
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4238.md:18
msgid ""
"Use `Type::_` to match all constructors of one suberror type, and `_` to "
"handle other error types. To handle known constructors separately, place "
"their cases before `Type::_`."
msgstr "使用 `Type::_` 匹配某一子错误类型的全部构造器，用 `_` 处理其他错误类型。如果需要单独处理已知构造器，将对应分支放在 `Type::_` 之前。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4238.md:22
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"#non_exhaustive\n"
"pub(all) suberror ParseError {\n"
"  InvalidInput\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn is_parse_error(error : Error) -> Bool {\n"
"  match error {\n"
"    ParseError::_ => true\n"
"    _ => false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
